    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ウイニングチケット",
            "enName": "Winning Ticket",
            "jpText": "タイシィーン！　おた、おたん、お誕生日――\nおめで〇▼※◇×□～～～！！",
            "enText": "Taishiiiin! H-Ha-happy… <i>burfaghuwahhhh</i>!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -6092711863080604611,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "…………なんて？",
            "enText": "…Happy what?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -4154906645183346837,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "もちろん『おめでとう』だよ、タイシン。\n……にしても、今日のチケットは\nいつも以上に凄まじい泣きっぷりだな。",
            "enText": "Happy \"birthday\", obviously… It seems \nthe occasion has Ticket crying even harder \nthan usual.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -8690290172359425087,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "そう？　いつもこんなんじゃない？\n初対面の相手の誕生日でも泣けるでしょ、\nコイツは。",
            "enText": "You think? Isn't she always like this? \nI mean, she'll cry for someone's birthday \neven if she just met them.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 3461135084498731677,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "いいや、常日頃から見ているからわかるさ。\n今日のチケットは、一段とよく泣いている。",
            "enText": "Believe me, with how much time I spend \naround her, I can tell. She's crying especially \nhard today.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 2770316986950911987,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "かく言う私も……うむ――",
            "enText": "And I… Mm-hm.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4757527603856217559,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "先日も熱を出し寝込んでいた君が、こうして\n無事ひとつ歳を重ねられたかと……思うと……\nくっ！",
            "enText": "Just the other day you were in bed with \na fever, but now here you are, turning one \nyear older… I… <i>Sniffle.</i>",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -2553309347675684011,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "いや、アンタはアタシのなんなの……って、\r\nは？　……ちょっと、マジで泣いてんの？",
            "enText": "Oh please, what are you trying to… \nHold on… are you crying for real?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 1655945678205594474,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウイニングチケット",
            "enName": "Winning Ticket",
            "jpText": "は、ハヤヒデ……！\nそうだよねぇ……うれしいよねぇ～～！！",
            "enText": "H-Hayahide! I get you! It just makes you \nso happy, doesn't iiiit?!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -2002918233735050061,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "うぉおおお～～～～ん！！\nくっ……！！",
            "enText": "<i>UWAAAAAAHHH! !\nNghhh!!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 2111441315331876449,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "あぁ～、もうっ……！\nなんなのアンタらは……！！",
            "enText": "Ugh, gimme a break! What's wrong \nwith you two?!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 4718731516328760147,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "ホント……なんなわけ、バーカ。",
            "enText": "Seriously, you're both such… dummies.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 2316365523490487375,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
